# Instance / user data must never enter this repo.
# 2026-09-26: a 22.8 MB SillyTavern settings.json dump (containing api_key / secret /
# password / token fields) was accidentally committed and pushed to this PUBLIC repo.
# It was purged from the tip commit via amend + force-push, but the lesson is: keep
# local safety backups OUTSIDE the repository, and let these patterns catch mistakes.
settings-backup-*.json
*settings*backup*.json
instance-backup/
*.pre-enable-backup.json
